            "review_title": "Review at SENSEN Vietnamese cuisine",
            "review_text": "Tuan Minh\nDa Nang, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\ni really enjoy the bun cha dish while here, highly recommend\nMar 2024 • Family\nThis is truly a memorable experience for Vietnamese people traveling and staying in foreigners' walking streets. I'm also a pure Vietnamese food eater, so finding a restaurant that sells delicious Vietnamese food is really difficult in this area, so when I came and i really enjoyed the bun cha dish. Although the restaurant space is limited, the food is very delicious and the service is good and fast.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 8, 2024",
