            "review_title": "Review at SENSEN Vietnamese cuisine",
            "review_text": "Lynette P\n9 contributions\n0\nGive it a miss\nApr 2023 • Solo\nLooks inviting at first glance however as soon as I sat down I realised the place is dirty. There was only one other table of diners and the restaurant had rubbish all over the floor, dirty serviettes, food, cigarette butts the other tables were also covered in rubbish. \nI ordered a beer and was given something completely different with no explanation. No problem a beer is a beer. Ordered two dishes both were freshly cooked. Food was overpriced for what it was. Staff were pleasant but glued to their phones. A real shame but no sense of the staff wanting to be there.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 8, 2023",
